      "description": "Chie is a cel-painter at the animation studio where Kintaro works as an errand-boy. Production difficulties ensue, and Kintaro must rely on old friends to pull things through. An animated rendition of  Egawa Tatsuya, voiced by the author himself, makes a cameo appearance in this episode."
